Analyze this CSV text. Process every CSV row independently. Return ONLY a valid JSON array, with one object per input row, and no Markdown or code fences. Each object must preserve the row's original fields and add exactly these classification fields: existence_tag, application_tag, classification_note. existence_tag must be exactly PENALTY_EXIST or NO_PENALTY. If existence_tag is PENALTY_EXIST, application_tag must be exactly PENALTY_APPLIES or PENALTY_NOT_APPLICABLE. If existence_tag is NO_PENALTY, application_tag must be null. Do not invent missing values; use classification_note when the source is insufficient to determine the classification.

